Package: zuutforacle
Title: zufast as an Oracle for zuutf
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Not a real package and never published. It compiles zufast's
    scalar UTF-8 validator and strict Base64 decoder, and compares them with
    zuutf on zuutf's corpus and on a million random byte strings (design
    §10, D12). It is built and run only by hardening.yaml, so zuutf never
    depends on zufast.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports: 
    zuutf
LinkingTo: 
    zufast,
    zuutf
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
